data/factors.json carries the energy, CO2e and water factors of claude-carbon
(https://github.com/gwittebolle/claude-carbon), MIT License,
Copyright (c) Gaëtan Wittebolle. Its deduplication rule for transcripts is also
taken from claude-carbon.

data/sites.json carries values of WRI Aqueduct 4.0 (https://www.wri.org/aqueduct),
World Resources Institute, licensed CC BY 4.0.

data/sites.json carries values of US EPA eGRID2023 rev2 (https://www.epa.gov/egrid),
a US government work in the public domain.

data/nature.json carries characterisation factors of ReCiPe 2016 v1.1
(RIVM Report 2016-0104a, Huijbregts et al. 2017) and land-use intensities of
Lovering et al. 2022, PLOS ONE 17(7): e0270155 (CC BY 4.0).
